The Belvedere library stands on the edge of the [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Masque District/index|Masque District]], a building the size of a city block. [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]] keeps no public libraries, so this one is open only to members of [[Org/Belvedere/index|Belvedere]] and to guests they escort, and its size is a statement of Belvedere's reach this far from [[Geography/Austrene/index|Austrene]]. Shelves three stories high hold crates labeled with numbers instead of browsable books; a reader asks at a kiosk and the crate is brought to a table, and nothing leaves the building.
